<title>BRAZIL: FORECAST - Survey of Telebras 1997 forecasts.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Survey of Telebras 1997 forecasts.</headline>
<text>
<p>SAO PAULO, June 23 - The following are forecasts of consolidated 1997 financial results for Brazilian telecoms and local banks.</p>
<p>Telebras, Brazil's benchmark blue chip, accounts for more than 60 percent of daily trade on the nation's stock exchanges and is a leading ADR in New York.</p>
<p>The survey is updated monthly, following the release of Telebras results.</p>
<p>===============================</p>
<p>			Telebras Corporate Forecast</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> 1997		EPS     Net Profit    Net Sales   Oper Inc</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>BankBoston     $10.57    $3.391 bn     $14.371 bn   $5.600 bn</p>
<p>Caspian	  $12.50    $4.181 bn     $16.318 bn   $6.720 bn</p>
<p>Flemings	  $9.50    $3.190 bn     $14.696 bn   $5.283 bn</p>
<p>FonteCindam     $9.87    $3.394 bn     $14.162 bn   $5.446 bn</p>
<p>ING Barings    $10.40    $3.330 bn     $15.660 bn   $5.410 bn</p>
<p>Lloyds Asset    $9.98    $3.200 bn     $14.150 bn   $5.650 bn</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch   $9.80    $3.190 bn     $14.277 bn   $4.441 bn</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley $10.76    $3.451 bn     $13.896 bn   $5.324 bn</p>
<p>Pactual	  $11.80    $3.783 bn     $15.934 bn   $6.284 bn</p>
<p>===============================</p>
<p>   1997		 EBITDA	 Fixed Lines	Cellular</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    BankBoston	$9.159 bn	14.95 mn	  4.25 mn</p>
<p>    Caspian	   $10.49 bn	15.07 mn	  4.60 mn</p>
<p>    Flemings	  $9.342 bn	15.36 mn	  4.30 mn</p>
<p>    FonteCindam     $9.051 bn	15.00 mn	  4.14 mn</p>
<p>    ING Barings     $9.154 bn	15.26 mn	  4.96 mn</p>
<p>    Lloyds Asset    $10.01 bn	15.45 mn	  3.83 mn</p>
<p>    Merrill Lynch   $8.279 bn	14.92 mn	  3.66 mn</p>
<p>    Morgan Stanley  $9.119 bn	15.21 mn	  4.34 mn</p>
<p>    Pactual	   $9.851 bn	15.73 mn	  4.97 mn</p>
<p>===============================</p>
<p>			     Consensus Forecasts</p>
<p>		    Average	   Median	     Last Year</p>
<p>EPS		 $10.58	    $10.40	     $8.60</p>
<p>Net Profit	$3.457  bn	$3.391  bn	 $2.739  bn</p>
<p>Net Sales	 $14.829 bn	$14.371 bn	 $12.413 bn</p>
<p>Oper Inc	  $5.573  bn	$5.446  bn	 $3.719  bn</p>
<p>EBITDA	    $9.384  bn	$9.159  bn	 $7.262  bn</p>
<p>Fixed Lines     15.22   mn	15.21   mn	 13.46   mn</p>
<p>Cellular	  4.340   mn	4.300   mn	 2.450   mn</p>
<p>===============================</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are consolidated and in U.S. dollars, except for fixed lines and cellular columns, which refer to number of lines in service at year's end.</p>
